	<capabilities>
		<!-- Names taken verbatim from Control4's official lock_proxy template
		     (lock_main.lua). The proxy reads these via C4:GetCapability(); an
		     empty <capabilities> block leaves every one of them nil, which is
		     why the driver was never offered as a lock in Navigator.
		     This driver exposes lock/unlock and telemetry only - no user
		     codes, keypad settings or on-device history - so the management
		     capabilities are all declared false. -->
